Verification: 
Ensures the product is being built correctly according to specifications.
= “Are we building the product right?”
Focus	= Process & design
Performed by	Developers, QA team
Techniques	Reviews, inspections, walkthroughs
Timing	= During development
Goal	=  Conformance to requirements
Checking that the login page code follows the design document
example = username field accepts only alphanumeric input.


Validation:
Ensures the product meets the user’s needs and expectations. 
= “Are we building the right product?”
Focus= Final product & user needs
Performed by = End users, testers
Techniques = Functional testing, UAT (User Acceptance Testing)
Timing = After development, before release
Goal = Suitability for intended use.
example = Testing that users can successfully log in and access their dashboard as expected.
